198: def mask32(mb, me):
199:     """MASK(MB+32, ME+32) at SIXTY-FOUR bits -- NOT confined to the low word.
200: 
201:        *** CORRECTED 2026-09-11.  This was a low-32-confined loop, so want_rlwinm ANDed
202:        away the duplication rotl32 correctly produces, and want_rlwimi preserved ALL of
203:        [*** SENTENCE TRUNCATED.  The rest of this 2026-09-11 clause was lost when the
204:        correction block below was inserted AT A LINE BOUNDARY rather than a sentence
205:        boundary.  Found by the Opus 5 seat 2026-09-17, which found the SAME habit in
206:        mvme_pcctworeg.h in the same working set.  THE MISSING WORDS ARE NOT
207:        RECONSTRUCTED HERE -- inventing them would be the wrong repair in a file whose
