19342: ### `sgirandomcolour` -- *** `#519` DOES NOT CLOSE.  PASS 2 MEASURED A FLOOR BREACH, 2026-09-11. ***
19343: 
19344: **Six mutants score 59/59 on the shipped instrument and every one writes uninitialised host stack into
