52: #  All twelve default nibbles are driven, but are not crossed with this
53: #  entire projection.  GET, accepted-type width semantics, invalid-input
54: #  paths, per-instance/reset behavior and cold/warm memory paths are not closed.
55: #  Existing acceptance, nibble, coordinate and latch-independence rows retain
